{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temtem: Swarm mixes the simple, nail-biting fun of survivor games with Temtem\u2019s strategic battles, letting you cook up all kinds of clever strategies with friends or randoms in a world full of familiar creatures and vibrant vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/15afb24542b3e533fddb8142294e7e52.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=611 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/15afb24542b3e533fddb8142294e7e52.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Up to 3 friends can face relentless swarms of Tems together. Don't have friends to play with? No worries, use the matchmaking system to find other Swarmers! Strategize, share resources(or don\u2019t!), and take down increasingly more powerful bosses. Maximize your attack potential by coordinating gears and skills with precision timing, creating overpowered synergies. The ultimate test of teamwork and survival awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/2e31f01e0189df600876afd0ba1b8f0e.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/2e31f01e0189df600876afd0ba1b8f0e.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer each stage by defeating challenging mini-bosses and formidable stage bosses with devastating abilities. Strategize, pivot, and prove your skills as you face off against powerful Tems like Gharunder, Yowlar, and Nessla. Only the boldest will emerge victorious - so gear up to defeat them and clear every hand-crafted stage before the swarm overwhelms you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/e3bc6276bc3bd3517efbe9674321f845.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/e3bc6276bc3bd3517efbe9674321f845.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have incredible power at your command. Choose when to tap into your Tem\u2019s full potential and unleash devastating attacks, defensive abilities, or power-ups that help you and your friends clear the map in one fell swoop. With great power comes great responsibility...are you up to the task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/4b3bc5c18b31323d2ffb726e395bfdac.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/4b3bc5c18b31323d2ffb726e395bfdac.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptation is the key to surviving and your Tems are built for it! Collect XP after defeating enemies to level up, grow stronger, and unlock your final evolution. Each evolution brings massive power-ups to your skills and strength. Are you prepared to evolve and endure in this exciting adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/ee37eb04117aafe51fe6f8a34b996611.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/ee37eb04117aafe51fe6f8a34b996611.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and capture every available Tem to unlock their powerful Traits and unique Ultimate abilities. Experience the magic of every Tem and master them in both solo and co-op modes to rise to the challenge!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/b5efd2580a73f10504c06db3207bfaba.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/b5efd2580a73f10504c06db3207bfaba.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting pummeled by Oceara's punishing attacks? No problem - when the going gets tough, the tough get going! Online co-op has Ghost Mode \u2014 Support your friends until they can safely revive you and rejoin the fight. Defeat isn\u2019t game over, fight on in Ghost Mode!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cipanku survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/9a23c7a9f3fcf84aa324265542e4df095ca8f48f.jpg"},{"name":"Top dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/82e22e1f899d6c159fc5bac7484ab8a5817a90fb.jpg"},{"name":"Heart hacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/89355bf0b9f64f5d104424514a507b70460870fe.jpg"},{"name":"Faster than lightning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/bd5be1b8e365a14dcdb34060b3e99cbc52744365.jpg"},{"name":"Cipanku tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/f8ca70f444285c13a18cc682e251a48b68c67106.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror of lightning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/b9908f2985cecc4f57ebaef8fc1d165bbad5455e.jpg"},{"name":"A stroll on the beach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/7bc37fbf5b37603878342dad0ce42fbf8f76c259.jpg"},{"name":"Bacon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/b4250897d5e252fb0e16a0ef44c3a42319345b37.jpg"},{"name":"Fast surfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/fade0b2229baabe8a836534c42abfccb471387df.jpg"},{"name":"Deniz tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510960/9e7799ff82a615764a06be054756c4fd14de7ad0.jpg"}],"total":105},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510960?t=1766066847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766066847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/fa23b88cb733238327dc75acd4dcd381cc925d0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766066847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/fa23b88cb733238327dc75acd4dcd381cc925d0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766066847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2819550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/10d704f2eeebb6de2e54a0dbc431c63e.avif?t=1766066847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras_big/10d704f2eeebb6de2e54a0dbc431c63e.webp?t=1766066847 width=1560 height=2696 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temtem: Swarm mixes the simple, nail-biting fun of survivor games with Temtem\u2019s strategic battles, letting you cook up all kinds of clever strategies with friends or randoms in a world full of familiar creatures and vibrant vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/15afb24542b3e533fddb8142294e7e52.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=611 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/15afb24542b3e533fddb8142294e7e52.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Up to 3 friends can face relentless swarms of Tems together. Don't have friends to play with? No worries, use the matchmaking system to find other Swarmers! Strategize, share resources(or don\u2019t!), and take down increasingly more powerful bosses. Maximize your attack potential by coordinating gears and skills with precision timing, creating overpowered synergies. The ultimate test of teamwork and survival awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/2e31f01e0189df600876afd0ba1b8f0e.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/2e31f01e0189df600876afd0ba1b8f0e.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer each stage by defeating challenging mini-bosses and formidable stage bosses with devastating abilities. Strategize, pivot, and prove your skills as you face off against powerful Tems like Gharunder, Yowlar, and Nessla. Only the boldest will emerge victorious - so gear up to defeat them and clear every hand-crafted stage before the swarm overwhelms you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/e3bc6276bc3bd3517efbe9674321f845.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/e3bc6276bc3bd3517efbe9674321f845.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have incredible power at your command. Choose when to tap into your Tem\u2019s full potential and unleash devastating attacks, defensive abilities, or power-ups that help you and your friends clear the map in one fell swoop. With great power comes great responsibility...are you up to the task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/4b3bc5c18b31323d2ffb726e395bfdac.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/4b3bc5c18b31323d2ffb726e395bfdac.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptation is the key to surviving and your Tems are built for it! Collect XP after defeating enemies to level up, grow stronger, and unlock your final evolution. Each evolution brings massive power-ups to your skills and strength. Are you prepared to evolve and endure in this exciting adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/ee37eb04117aafe51fe6f8a34b996611.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/ee37eb04117aafe51fe6f8a34b996611.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and capture every available Tem to unlock their powerful Traits and unique Ultimate abilities. Experience the magic of every Tem and master them in both solo and co-op modes to rise to the challenge!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/b5efd2580a73f10504c06db3207bfaba.poster.avif?t=1766066847\" width=615 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/extras/b5efd2580a73f10504c06db3207bfaba.webm?t=1766066847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting pummeled by Oceara's punishing attacks? No problem - when the going gets tough, the tough get going! Online co-op has Ghost Mode \u2014 Support your friends until they can safely revive you and rejoin the fight. Defeat isn\u2019t game over, fight on in Ghost Mode!</p>","developers":["Crema","GGTech Studios"],"dlc":[3251380],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510960/header.jpg?t=1766066847","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Crema. Temtem and the Temtem logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of CremaGames S.L. in the U.S. and/or other countries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00a92025 GGTech. GGTech Studios and GGTech Studios logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of GGTech Entertainment S.L. in Europe and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510960/400891927/d47c821d8fee42a57574ef3f0aa4614892bcdb2e/1758521643/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758527879","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510960/400891927/d47c821d8fee42a57574ef3f0aa4614892bcdb2e/1758521643/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758527879","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama